+<p>The model clears the owner-income target only because retainers carry the business and platform licences stay outside revenue. At €12 per event, 4,000 events produce €48,000: less than one engineer. Two manual hours per event would consume roughly four working years before support. The ordinary event must therefore be mostly automatic.</p>
