 <section class="economics">
 <h2>Does the money work?</h2>
 <p>A high-value stationary system may contain fewer passported units than a vehicle programme. Per-passport fees cannot carry this company. The retainer pays for the changing state: supplier evidence arrives, tests are rerun, a donor lineage is corrected, roles change, a unit is updated, a standard or data rule changes, or an authority asks for proof. The event fee disciplines volume; the operating retainer funds readiness.</p>
