+<p>Neutrality, second-life lineage and managed exceptions are hypotheses, not established moats. Circularise may satisfy all three through its native workflow or services. A customer's ERP team may also generate the payload at source. <!-- CHECK: 05-erp-substitute --> Formal interoperability increases that pressure. The Regulation requires transferable data without vendor lock-in. <!-- CHECK: 05-operator-responsibility --> The registry indexes rather than stores the complete record. <!-- CHECK: 05-registry-live --> Those rules protect exit but commoditise translation.</p>
