+<p>Use an incumbent to reach production, while keeping customer-controlled export and a provider-neutral test suite. Kill this offer if two qualified buyers accept Circularise's native workflow, without paid external exception management, after testing their real second-life data. In that case, an entrant would duplicate a product rather than own a neglected operation.</p>
