+<tr><td>Supplier evidence</td><td>Requests, normalises and reviews declarations, certificates and field evidence. <!-- CHECK: 05-circularise --></td><td>No feature edge. Only accountable human pursuit of missing or rejected evidence across the customer's chosen host.</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Field ownership</td><td>Maps passport fields to owners, suppliers and systems, then automates evidence requests. <!-- CHECK: 05-circularise --></td><td>No edge unless the buyer pays for a managed exception SLA instead of operating Circularise itself.</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Traceability</td><td>Links identifiers, batch history, supplier evidence and claims into an auditable trail. <!-- CHECK: 05-circularise --></td><td>Test multi-donor second-life lineage and the new battery record. Do not claim an edge until Circularise fails that authorised test.</td></tr>
